  "description": "Explore the fascinating world of the zodiac as you meet irresistible girls and fight to protect their hearts. Combine revealing questions with exciting defence gameplay to unlock suggestive images and unexpected endings.\n\nDiscover how each girl is deeply influenced by her astrological sign and test your intuition as you progress through this adventure.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n● Unique Dual Gameplay: Alternate between answering astrological questions and defence mode, where you must protect the girl's heart from attacks to unlock new images.\n\n● Suggestive Images and Unique Moments: Discover special scenes and personal traits as you advance through the story.\n\n● Explore Her Zodiac Personality: Each answer reveals details about her character, desires, and secrets based on her astrological sign.\n\n● Multiple Endings: Your fate will depend on how many questions you answer correctly, how well you defend her heart, and how you interpret the zodiac signs.\n\n● Secret and Spicy Question: Reach question 150 to unveil a special final moment related to the zodiac.\n\n\nCan you protect their hearts and unravel the astrological mysteries that connect them to you?\n\nDive into this adventure where strategy and romance go hand in hand!",
